{"parentUuid":"4c95874b-f47b-43e8-b434-3ee7357f59d5","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a823b529b0879c4bb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016XmNNDMkyzkhXuR19Gxo1Y","type":"tool_result","content":"25:from src.models.cut_manager import (\n26:    BendersCut,\n27:    CutManager,\n68:_EXACT_INTERNAL_STATUS_MASTER_CUT_ADDED_CONTINUE = \"master_cut_added_continue\"\n224:    proof_summary = _merge_reuse_metadata(\n267:        used_exact_core_reuse=True,\n271:        cut_replay_seconds=0.0,\n474:    _publish_last_run_metadata({}, [], loaded_exact_safe_cut_count=0, generated_exact_safe_cut_count=0)\n479:    exact_safe_cuts: Sequence[BendersCut],\n481:    loaded_exact_safe_cut_count: int = 0,\n482:    generated_exact_safe_cut_count: int = 0,\n487:        \"exact_safe_cuts\": [cut.to_dict() for cut in exact_safe_cuts],\n488:        \"loaded_exact_safe_cut_count\": int(loaded_exact_safe_cut_count),\n489:        \"generated_exact_safe_cut_count\": int(generated_exact_safe_cut_count),\n490:        \"fine_grained_exact_safe_cut_count\": int(\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 15]"}]},"uuid":"9bcfc8d1-0497-4331-9883-f16d2c7ea4f9","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:27:28.777Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4c95874b-f47b-43e8-b434-3ee7357f59d5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9bcfc8d1-0497-4331-9883-f16d2c7ea4f9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a823b529b0879c4bb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Vdfq5ZY27SAWVcJCWWJFJc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013tCb49mTrEQnjbZWpFrxSh","name":"Grep","input":{"pattern":"\"final_status\"|\"best_objective\"|\"best_bound\"|UNKNOWN|stop_reason","path":"D:/claude pj/zmd/src/search/exact_campaign.py","output_mode":"content","-n":true,"head_limit":20},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1119,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4680,"cache_read_input_tokens":47678,"output_tokens":453,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4680},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1119,"output_tokens":453,"cache_read_input_tokens":47678,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4680,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Caozj3zqCzGPE8qhKYxU4","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"cad8fe1c-d216-4980-9a02-136edd708812","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:27:30.367Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"cad8fe1c-d216-4980-9a02-136edd708812","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a823b529b0879c4bb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013tCb49mTrEQnjbZWpFrxSh","type":"tool_result","content":"30:    \"UNKNOWN\",\n43:    \"final_status\",\n44:    \"last_stop_reason\",\n170:        \"status\": \"UNKNOWN\",\n195:        \"final_status\": None,\n196:        \"last_stop_reason\": None,\n259:    if state.get(\"last_stop_reason\") is not None:\n260:        stop_reason = state.get(\"last_stop_reason\")\n261:        if not isinstance(stop_reason, Mapping) or \"reason\" not in stop_reason:\n262:            return \"last_stop_reason_invalid\"\n264:    final_status = state.get(\"final_status\")\n329:                        stop = state.get(\"last_stop_reason\")\n334:                            state[\"last_stop_reason\"] = None\n335:                            state[\"final_status\"] = None\n404:        self.state[\"last_stop_reason\"] = None\n406:            self.state[\"final_status\"] = None\n470:                self.state[\"final_status\"] = \"CERTIFIED\"\n471:                self.state[\"last_stop_reason\"] = None\n510:        self.state[\"last_stop_reason\"] = stop_record\n513:                self.state[\"final_status\"] = \"CERTIFIED\"\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 20]"}]},"uuid":"9b2833ac-b16e-4306-a019-35f674311d62","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:27:30.423Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cad8fe1c-d216-4980-9a02-136edd708812","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9b2833ac-b16e-4306-a019-35f674311d62","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a823b529b0879c4bb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01QHUHRnnEyJJNx7zbHQDTnT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good - I can see that **`exact_safe_cuts`** persistence DOES exist (cuts are persisted with `to_dict()`/`loaded_exact_safe_cut_count`). But `best_bound`/`best_objective`/`gap`/`epsilon` keys are absent from campaign state. That's the key local finding. Now I have everything to deliver the report.\n\n---\n\n# 调研报告：Anytime ε-Certificate 在 Multi-Wave 求解之间的 Bound 传递（2024-2026 工程进展）\n\n## 1. 三大商用/学术求解器的 hot-start / warm-bound 接口现状\n\n**Gurobi（最完整，但不暴露 dual bound 跨实例 API）**\n- `Model.read()/write()` 支持 `.mst`（解 hint）、`.hnt`（带置信度的 hint）、`.bas`（LP basis）、`.prm`（参数）。但 `best_objective_bound` 不能反向\"灌\"回新一轮求解作为初始 dual bound——只能作为外部停止判据。\n- LP 层有 `LPWarmStart`（9.5 引入），MIP 层等价于 CPLEX 的 `AdvInd` 仍在 roadmap，2025 年仍未交付。\n- `InfUnbdInfo=1` 后可读 `FarkasDual`/`FarkasProof`（dual ray 序列化），跨进程传递时 **要注意非唯一性**——同一 LP 不同求解器会给不同合法证书，所以做 cut 时只能视作 hint，不能视作 canonical key。\n\n**CPLEX**\n- `AdvInd` 参数 + `.sav`/`.mst` 是传统 warm-start 路径。`MIP_Cuts_*` 池子是会话内有效，不跨 `cplex.solve()` 调用持久化。\n\n**SCIP**\n- 唯一有\"reoptimization\"模式（`set reoptimization advanced enable TRUE`）的开源求解器，会保留搜索树片段、cut pool 和 conflict graph 跨连续 solve 调用。这是 2024-2026 这条赛道里**最接近你想要的\"bound carryover\"**的现成实现，但需要模型签名\"足够相似\"（变量集合不变，只能加约束/改目标系数）。\n\n**CP-SAT（你们用的）—— 关键限制**\n- 官方 group 帖反复确认：**`Solve()` 是 stateless 的**。修改 `CpModel` 后再调一次，求解器会从零重扫 proto。\n- 暴露的\"跨调用持久化\"只有：\n  - `solver.parameters.use_optimization_hints` + `model.add_hint()`（解 hint，全变量）\n  - `solver.parameters.repair_hint=True`（hint 不可行时尝试修复）\n  - `solver.parameters.fill_tightened_domains_in_response`（response 里返回 worker 收紧后的变量域，**这是目前 CP-SAT 唯一公开的\"跨 solve dual 信息\"通道**）\n- worker 间运行时共享在 `sat_parameters.proto` 里有：`share_objective_bounds`、`share_level_zero_bounds`、`share_binary_clauses`、`share_glue_clauses`、`minimize_shared_clauses`。**全部仅限同进程内 worker**，不跨 `Solve()` 调用，更不跨进程。\n- 无 cut pool 导出 API，`best_objective_bound` 只读、不可灌回。\n\n## 2. Dual ray / Farkas 证书的序列化\n\n- Gurobi `FarkasDual` + `FarkasProof` 是当前事实标准，对应一个稠密向量 + 标量，可直接 JSON。CPLEX 类似，差一个符号。\n- **非唯一性**意味着不能用作\"是否需要重算\"的指纹——每个求解器实例可能给不同合法证书。要做指纹得对结构归一化（按变量索引排序、按系数 GCD 归一）。\n- CP-SAT 没有 Farkas 接口（CDCL 内核没有 LP 对偶概念）。等价物是**学到的二元/glue 子句**——这些只在进程内 worker 间共享，没暴露 export/import。\n\n## 3. Cut pool 跨实例复用\n\n- HordeSat / D-Painless（CP 2025 的 D-Painless 论文）证明：分布式 SAT 跨进程**学习子句交换**已是工业级，IPASIR-2 标准已经规定了 import/export 异步 API。\n- 但 **CP-SAT 没有实现 IPASIR-2**。Lazy clause generation 的反向重建语义在 OR-Tools 内部受限于 propagator 的私有状态，不公开 export。\n- 现实可用的\"跨 wave cut 复用\"路径只有**在你自己代码层重做**——把每个 wave 推导出的\"可证安全 cut\"用 OR-Tools 公开建模 API（线性约束 / no-good 约束）重新加进下一个 master，**项目里已经在做这件事**（`src/models/cut_manager.py`、`exact_safe_cuts` 持久化、`loaded_exact_safe_cut_count`）。这是正确路线，不需要等 OR-Tools 给原生支持。\n\n## 4. ε-bound proof certificate 的格式\n\n- **VeriPB（伪布尔证书）是 2024-2026 的明确赢家**。\n  - 子句证明系统覆盖 DRAT，且对 cutting plane 推理给出线性大小证书（DRAT 在这类推理上是二次大小）。\n  - 已被用于：Certified MaxSAT Preprocessing（CP 2024）、多目标 MaxSAT Pareto 最优证明（2025）、最优经典规划（ICAPS 2025）、**MIP 0-1 ILP 的 presolve 还原证书**（arXiv 2401.09277，ISMP 2024 的 WC266 专题）。\n  - PB Competition 2025 已强制要求 VeriPB 格式。\n- DRAT 仍是纯 SAT 不可满足证书的工业默认，但对优化问题（特别是 ε-bound）已被 VeriPB 取代。\n- 你们要做\"ε=5%/1%/0% 三阶段证明链\"，**目标格式应该锁 VeriPB**——一个理由是它原生支持\"目标函数边界\"作为约束证明（`obju`/`objl` 指令），DRAT 只能证 UNSAT。\n\n## 5. 多 wave bound regression 诊断\n\n学术上 anytime CP（Lecoutre 等）讨论的多是单实例内的 incumbent 序列单调性，不直接给跨实例 regression 检测。工程实践里通用做法：\n- 每 wave 收尾写入 `(candidate_id, lb, ub, gap, time)` 五元组。\n- 下 wave 启动前断言 `lb_new >= lb_old - tolerance`。违反就触发 audit：模型签名变了？候选裁剪不安全？cut 误删？\n- 这个机制项目当前**没有**——`exact_campaign_state.json` 里完全没有 `lb`/`ub`/`best_bound`/`gap` 字段（我搜了，零匹配）。\n\n## 6. 项目 checkpoint schema 现状（实证）\n\n读 `data/checkpoints/exact_campaign_state.json`（schema_version 3）：\n- 有：`final_status`、`last_stop_reason`、`master_status`、`benders_iterations`、各种 prune 计数。\n- **没有**：任何 `best_objective`、`best_bound`、`lb`、`ub`、`gap`、`epsilon`、`dual_bound`、`bound_history`。\n- `exact_safe_cuts` 在另一条路径（`_publish_last_run_metadata`）写出，**没有按 candidate 分桶 + bound 关联**——只是一个\"安全 cut 全集\"。\n\n这意味着**目前的 checkpoint 不足以支撑\"上一 wave 跑到 ε=5% 还差多少\"这类问题**——三阶段 ε 收敛在工程上是断的。\n\n## 7. AnyTime CP 文献（Lecoutre / Boussemart）\n\nLecoutre 2024-2026 的工作主要在 XCSP3 标准、conflict-driven 启发式、最近一次冲突重启（last conflict reasoning）。**没有专门讨论\"跨 wave ε-certificate\"**——这是个工程化空白。学术界的 anytime CP 模型还停留在\"同一 solve 内 incumbent 流\"这层抽象。所以你做这个补丁是**填空白**，没有现成 paper 可抄。\n\n---\n\n## 给 ε-Certified 三阶段加 1 个工程层 patch 清单\n\n按 ROI 排序，每条括号内是估算工时（Claude 节奏）。\n\n1. **扩展 checkpoint schema 到 `schema_version=4`，增加 `bound_state` 块**（30 min）  \n   每 candidate 存 `{lb, ub, gap, epsilon_target, prover, observed_at, model_hash}`。`final_status` 增加 `EPSILON_CERTIFIED` 状态，区分 `CERTIFIED`（ε=0）和 `EPSILON_CERTIFIED@5%`/`@1%`。schema_version 升级要同步改 `PROJECT_LOCK.md` + `FILE_STATUS.md` + 测试。\n\n2. **Bound regression guard**（20 min）  \n   `exact_campaign.py` 在写 candidate 状态时加断言：新 lb ≥ 旧 lb − tol。违反则记 `BOUND_REGRESSION` 事件到 audit log，但**不阻塞**求解（因为 model_hash 可能合法变化，需要人审）。\n\n3. **Cut pool 按 ε 阶段分桶**（45 min）  \n   `cut_manager.py` 现在的 `exact_safe_cuts` 是扁平池。改成 `{stage_5pct: [...], stage_1pct: [...], stage_0pct: [...]}`。规则：5% 阶段证出的 cut 在 1% 阶段直接复用（更松的 ε 推出的 cut 在更紧的 ε 下仍合法），反向不行。这条**就地能做**，不依赖 OR-Tools。\n\n4. **CP-SAT response 收紧域回灌**（30 min）  \n   打开 `solver.parameters.fill_tightened_domains_in_response = True`，把 response 里的收紧域写入 checkpoint，下一 wave 建模时用作初始变量域上界——这是 CP-SAT 公开的唯一\"跨 solve dual 信息\"，目前项目没用。\n\n5. **Hint 跨 wave 持久化**（30 min）  \n   每个 wave 出完整解后，把 `(var, value)` 全量 hint 写入 `data/checkpoints/hints/<candidate>.json`。下一 wave 同 candidate 启动时 `model.add_hint() + use_optimization_hints + repair_hint=True`。注意：hint 必须全变量覆盖才有效。\n\n6. **VeriPB 输出适配器（postprocess-only）**（90 min）  \n   在 `src/adapters/` 下加 `veripb_certificate_export.py`，把 final `CERTIFIED` 结果 + 累积 cut 池转成 VeriPB `.opb` + `.pbp` 双文件。**严格 postprocess**，不影响 solve schema。先做导出，验证用 `veripb` CLI（PB Competition 2025 的官方 checker）跑通一个 70x12 INFEASIBLE candidate 即可。这条让你在外部宣称\"形式可验证\"，是 phase 3C 的产物级 deliverable。\n\n7. **Farkas-style master infeasibility 指纹归一化**（60 min）  \n   master 出 INFEASIBLE 时，从 `master_boundary_port_feasibility` 的 `screened_infeasible_anchor_count` 推出\"哪几个 anchor 联合不可行\"，按 anchor 索引排序 + GCD 归一存为 cut 指纹，跨 candidate 查重。这条解决\"非唯一证书无法做 dedup key\"的问题。\n\n8. **Bound 流式 telemetry → S4 AI dataset**（20 min）  \n   把每 wave 的 `(time, lb, ub, gap)` 序列写到 `data/telemetry/bound_traces/`，喂给 S4 AI sidecar。AI 可以学\"bound 平台期检测\"——只用作 hint，不写回 checkpoint，符合 AI Safety Contract。\n\n合计约 5 小时，全是**工程层**改动，不动 PROJECT_LOCK 的 exactness 语义（除了第 1 条 schema 升级要走 lock-update 流程）。\n\n---\n\n**Sources:**\n- [CP-SAT warm restart discussion (or-tools-discuss)](https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss/c/5yh9MDP9neU)\n- [CP-SAT Primer parameters](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html)\n- [CP-SAT Primer how-it-works](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/07_under_the_hood.html)\n- [OR-Tools sat_parameters.proto](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\n- [Gurobi FarkasDual / FarkasProof](https://support.gurobi.com/hc/en-us/community/posts/360078072572-FarkasDual-and-FarkasProof)\n- [Gurobi reuse model warm start](https://support.gurobi.com/hc/en-us/community/posts/31240690993553-Reuse-a-previously-optimized-model-for-warm-start)\n- [CPLEX AdvInd equivalent in Gurobi (roadmap)](https://support.gurobi.com/hc/en-us/community/posts/360077078831-Cplex-AdvInd-Advanced-Start-Switch-equivalent-in-Gurobi)\n- [VeriPB GitLab](https://gitlab.com/MIAOresearch/software/VeriPB)\n- [Pseudo Boolean Competition 2025](http://www.cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25/)\n- [Certified MaxSAT Preprocessing (CP 2024)](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-63498-7_24)\n- [Pareto Optimality in Multi-objective MaxSAT (2025)](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_6)\n- [Pseudo-Boolean Proof Logging for Optimal Classical Planning (2025)](https://arxiv.org/html/2504.18443)\n- [Certifying MIP-Based Presolve Reductions for 0-1 ILP (arXiv 2401.09277)](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.09277)\n- [ISMP 2024 WC266 Certified Optimization](https://ismp2024.gerad.ca/schedule/WC/266)\n- [LBBD Master with CP and DDP (CP 2024)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol307-cp2024/LIPIcs.CP.2024.32/LIPIcs.CP.2024.32.pdf)\n- [Multicut LBBD for batch plants (AIChE 2024)](https://aiche.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aic.18491)\n- [Distributed clause-sharing SAT proofs (J. Automated Reasoning 2025)](https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10817-025-09725-w)\n- [D-Painless distributed portfolio SAT (2025)](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_3)\n- [HordeSat](http://ktiml.mff.cuni.cz/~balyo/papers/horde.pdf)\n- [IPASIR 2 Workgroup](https://github.com/ipasir2)\n- [Christophe Lecoutre publications (dblp)](https://dblp.org/pid/95/2777.html)\n- [CP 2025 Proceedings](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/entities/volume/LIPIcs-volume-340)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2431,"cache_read_input_tokens":52358,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2431,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaozjbtUdPJTLt5a48DKT","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"4eddf69e-9bb6-4ab5-a48e-95534234971e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:29:20.278Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
